    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2091" root="بذر" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذِرٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِبْذَارَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, (M, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْذَارٌ</span></b> 
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْذَارَة</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِبْذَارٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْذَارَانِيٌّ</span></b> , (K,) (tropical:)  A
man <i>who talks much; loquacious;</i> (M, K;) and
so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُذَرَةٌ بُذَرَةٌ</span></b>  (IDrd, M) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَيْذَارَةٌ بَيْذَارَةٌ</span></b> :
(M:) <i>irrationally,</i> or <i>vainly,</i> or <i>frivolously, loquacious; a great babbler.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذُورٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَعَامٌ بَذِرٌ</span> [<i>Wheat,</i> or <i>food,</i>] <i>in which is</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُذَارَة</span>,
i. e. <i>increase, redundance, exuberance, plenty,</i> or
<i>abundance.</i> (T, * M, L, K. *)

